{"server":"tw","storyId":"story_lava_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_lava_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"姐妹","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_lava_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"d2052d6ed805e07b5789a7799fb338badf535563397390a3f328767d04640ca2","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"narration","text":"11:10 A.M.  天氣/晴\n羅德島本艦，第二艙室，幹員生活區"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"吸氣——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"——吐氣。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"清空頭腦，摒除雜念。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"好，沒問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"心跳沒有加快，情緒也很平穩。沒問題的，炎熔，你可以！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"這次一定能不發脾氣好好和芙蓉說話！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊，炎熔~你來得正好！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"今天的健康餐我也替你準備好了，一定要吃哦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？煩不煩啊誰要天天吃你那個什麼健康餐啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"——嘶——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"（不行，不行，炎熔，不能這樣說話。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"（要忍耐，拿出你占卜大師的意志來，控制住自己......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"（心平氣和，心平氣和。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"......呼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，不是，我是說......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"每天都是健康餐，有點膩了......不是說你煩，你別多想啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，你在說什麼傻話呢，我當然知道炎熔不會嫌姐姐煩啦~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"來，這是今天的午餐，一定要一點不剩地全部吃完哦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"最近天氣變冷了，這樣均衡地攝取營養，才不容易生病知道嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"噁......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？怎麼啦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"那個啊......我說......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"這東西的口味先不論，你應該知道我最討厭吃番茄，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，當然知道呀？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"那為什麼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"——為什麼還要在我的午餐裡塞這麼多番茄啊！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，別激動，這當然是因為番茄很有營養啦~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"我可是知道的哦！炎熔總是會偷偷把菜裡不喜歡的部分夾給克洛絲吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，最近這段時間你基本上都只吃肉食，完全沒碰過蔬菜，是不是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"不可以這樣，不可以挑食！對炎熔這樣不乖乖聽話的“壞孩子”，懲罰就得要嚴厲一些才行！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"今天我一定會盯著你把這些都吃掉！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"（深呼吸）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"不能生氣不能生氣不能生氣。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"不能......啊啊啊不行忍不住了我受不了了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"能不能不要總是這樣！不要把我！當小孩子啊——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_canteen"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"結果怎麼還是搞成這個樣子了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"我真沒想和她吵架，只是那傢伙也太氣人了吧？哪有這樣逼人吃不喜歡的東西的，嘔，現在想起來還有點想吐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"行吧，說到底還是怪我沒控制住脾氣......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蛇屠箱","speakerId":"char_150_snakekiller","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼什麼，誰欺負炎熔啦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蛇屠箱","speakerId":"char_150_snakekiller","isRemote":false,"text":"快告訴我，我幫你去揍他！看我把欺負人的壞人打得滿地找牙！就像這樣——嘿！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"哇！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"你別亂揮球棒，這樣很危險的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，我怎麼記得博士之前說，已經禁止你在艦內用球棒打人了？上次被罰寫檢討書還不夠嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蛇屠箱","speakerId":"char_150_snakekiller","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，對哦！嗚......寫檢討書好討厭，不想再寫了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蛇屠箱","speakerId":"char_150_snakekiller","isRemote":false,"text":"不過沒關係，不用球棒也可以。看，我還可以用背包砸壞人！我的背包可好用了，阿米婭她們都誇我厲害呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蛇屠箱","speakerId":"char_150_snakekiller","isRemote":false,"text":"所以炎熔別擔心，教訓壞人就包在我身上！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"我才沒擔心......唉，停一停，你別鬧了，小心再被抓起來教訓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"而且也沒人欺負我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蛇屠箱","speakerId":"char_150_snakekiller","isRemote":false,"text":"真的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"真的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蛇屠箱","speakerId":"char_150_snakekiller","isRemote":false,"text":"（盯著看）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蛇屠箱","speakerId":"char_150_snakekiller","isRemote":false,"text":"炎熔騙人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蛇屠箱","speakerId":"char_150_snakekiller","isRemote":false,"text":"沒被欺負的話，炎熔為什麼會是這副表情，看起來好像很難過？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"難過？我......我有嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"不可能，肯定是你看錯了！我才沒——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蛇屠箱","speakerId":"char_150_snakekiller","isRemote":false,"text":"當然有，我是不會看錯的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蛇屠箱","speakerId":"char_150_snakekiller","isRemote":false,"text":"炎熔的眉毛明明就皺得和上次彈琴被琴蓋砸到手指的時候一樣！感覺好像很痛苦的樣子！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"這也太誇張了吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蛇屠箱","speakerId":"char_150_snakekiller","isRemote":false,"text":"我說的對不對嘛！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"......呃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，就算你說的對吧。但其實沒什麼大不了的，咳，就是和芙蓉那傢伙吵了一架而已，常有的事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蛇屠箱","speakerId":"char_150_snakekiller","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，又是和芙蓉姐有關？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蛇屠箱","speakerId":"char_150_snakekiller","isRemote":false,"text":"唔唔唔，如果是和芙蓉姐有關的話，那我就沒辦法幫炎熔了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蛇屠箱","speakerId":"char_150_snakekiller","isRemote":false,"text":"因為芙蓉姐不是壞人呀？上次芙蓉姐給我做檢查的時候可溫柔了，還給了我小蛋糕呢！超級好吃！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"切，那傢伙就會這樣做好人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"蛋糕有什麼稀奇的，我也不是不會做......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"而且以那傢伙的水準，要烤出現在這種能吃的程度的蛋糕，你知道在成功之前到底失敗過多少次嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"那些做壞了的東西又不能直接丟了，還不是每次都要強行抓我給她收拾爛攤子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蛇屠箱","speakerId":"char_150_snakekiller","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......嗯？不太懂！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蛇屠箱","speakerId":"char_150_snakekiller","isRemote":false,"text":"是能有很多蛋糕吃的意思？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"才不是這個意思！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"哎......算了，我和你說這些幹什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"總之，你要是真有個兄弟姐妹什麼的，就能明白姐姐這種生物有多麻煩了！特別是像芙蓉這樣又高壓又獨裁的傢伙......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蛇屠箱","speakerId":"char_150_snakekiller","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蛇屠箱","speakerId":"char_150_snakekiller","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"......喂，你幹嘛不說話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蛇屠箱","speakerId":"char_150_snakekiller","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，怎麼說呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蛇屠箱","speakerId":"char_150_snakekiller","isRemote":false,"text":"感覺，好好哦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？哪好了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蛇屠箱","speakerId":"char_150_snakekiller","isRemote":false,"text":"好好哦，有兄弟姐妹的感覺......我也好想體驗一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蛇屠箱","speakerId":"char_150_snakekiller","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然也可以拜託博士做我的兄弟姐妹，但是，果然還是和炎熔和芙蓉姐之間的感覺不太一樣吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，這個，應該......是不一樣吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蛇屠箱","speakerId":"char_150_snakekiller","isRemote":false,"text":"果然啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蛇屠箱","speakerId":"char_150_snakekiller","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蛇屠箱","speakerId":"char_150_snakekiller","isRemote":false,"text":"那個，炎熔啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"幹嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蛇屠箱","speakerId":"char_150_snakekiller","isRemote":false,"text":"我想到一個好主意——你乾脆把芙蓉姐讓給我做姐姐吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"噗——！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"咳、咳咳咳......你、你在亂說什麼啊？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蛇屠箱","speakerId":"char_150_snakekiller","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有亂說，我是很認真地在說啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"你到底搞清楚沒有，姐妹......親姐妹是有血緣關係的，就、就算你再想要，這也不是能讓給別人的東西啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蛇屠箱","speakerId":"char_150_snakekiller","isRemote":false,"text":"欸——有什麼關係嘛，反正我也不在乎什麼血緣不血緣的啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"那也不行！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蛇屠箱","speakerId":"char_150_snakekiller","isRemote":false,"text":"真的不行嗎？求你了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蛇屠箱","speakerId":"char_150_snakekiller","isRemote":false,"text":"炎熔不也總是說芙蓉姐是天敵，說她是邪惡的化身什麼的嘛，既然炎熔不想要姐姐的話，讓給我就好了呀！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"這、我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"不行。總之不行！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蛇屠箱","speakerId":"char_150_snakekiller","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有為什麼！不行就是不行！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蛇屠箱","speakerId":"char_150_snakekiller","isRemote":false,"text":"小氣！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"隨你怎麼說！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蛇屠箱","speakerId":"char_150_snakekiller","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼這樣啦，那好吧......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蛇屠箱","speakerId":"char_150_snakekiller","isRemote":false,"text":"不過說真的，炎熔為什麼總是和芙蓉姐鬧矛盾呀？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蛇屠箱","speakerId":"char_150_snakekiller","isRemote":false,"text":"我聽芬說，炎熔剛加入小隊的時候，一見芙蓉姐的面，差點當場就說要退出了，是不是真的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"芬怎麼連這個都和你說了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蛇屠箱","speakerId":"char_150_snakekiller","isRemote":false,"text":"所以是真的囉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"真的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蛇屠箱","speakerId":"char_150_snakekiller","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......但是好奇怪，炎熔之前難道都不知道芙蓉姐也在小隊裡嗎？咦，你們不是一起來羅德島的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"幹嘛問這個，你哪來那麼強的好奇心？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蛇屠箱","speakerId":"char_150_snakekiller","isRemote":false,"text":"告訴我嘛，告訴我嘛！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"別、別晃我......好吧，好吧，說給你聽就行了吧？麻煩死了，不過這也沒什麼好隱瞞的就是了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"我和芙蓉最初確實是一起離開家的，只不過，在中途出了點意外......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"那個，咳咳，我在路上和她吵了一架，所以我們半路就分開了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蛇屠箱","speakerId":"char_150_snakekiller","isRemote":false,"text":"一點都不讓人意外！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"囉嗦！我也知道這樣一點都不酷啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"當時是因為什麼吵架來著，想不起來了，算了......總之，吵架之後我氣不過，自己跑出去散心，結果一不小心跑得有點遠......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"荒地的地理特徵不太好分辨，我散心走的又不是有路標的那種官道，所以......就......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蛇屠箱","speakerId":"char_150_snakekiller","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，不會吧，難道是跑太遠然後就這樣迷路了？一個人在荒地裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"差不多吧。幸好之後遇到了商隊，被一路帶到萊塔尼亞附近。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蛇屠箱","speakerId":"char_150_snakekiller","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蛇屠箱","speakerId":"char_150_snakekiller","isRemote":false,"text":"炎熔，你啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蛇屠箱","speakerId":"char_150_snakekiller","isRemote":false,"text":"真是個小笨蛋——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"哈？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蛇屠箱","speakerId":"char_150_snakekiller","isRemote":false,"text":"小笨蛋！炎熔是個小笨蛋！怎麼會有人迷路從維多利亞走到萊塔尼亞啊哈哈哈哈——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"我被誰說都不想被你這麼說！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"但我的占卜沒出錯，這就是約定好的相遇啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我沒有跟著商隊走到萊塔尼亞，也就遇不到老師，沒有老師教我音樂，現在學習源石技藝肯定就沒那麼輕鬆了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蛇屠箱","speakerId":"char_150_snakekiller","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，確實，炎熔源石技藝學得又快又好......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蛇屠箱","speakerId":"char_150_snakekiller","isRemote":false,"text":"教官們和Pith姐都誇你呢，還有上次任務的時候見到的那個板著臉，眼睛長這樣，說話聲音還怪好聽的精英幹員先生，也是這麼說的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蛇屠箱","speakerId":"char_150_snakekiller","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼說來，最近炎熔每天都往訓練場跑，是不是就是在跟著那位先生學習？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"切，我倒是想，但哪有這種好事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"Logos大師這樣的重要人物，怎麼可能有時間專門教我，能像上次一樣指點兩句就已經很好了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"而且你剛剛那些形容是怎麼回事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蛇屠箱","speakerId":"char_150_snakekiller","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"歪頭裝傻也沒用！那可是大師，又酷又強又拉風優雅神秘沉穩的大師！對Logos大師得要用更尊敬一點的態度才行！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蛇屠箱","speakerId":"char_150_snakekiller","isRemote":false,"text":"哇......知道了知道了~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蛇屠箱","speakerId":"char_150_snakekiller","isRemote":false,"text":"炎熔真的很崇拜精英幹員先生啊......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"不是崇拜，是尊敬！對強者的尊敬！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，遲早有一天我也會變得像他一樣強！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蛇屠箱","speakerId":"char_150_snakekiller","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，哦哦......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蛇屠箱","speakerId":"char_150_snakekiller","isRemote":false,"text":"（但是炎熔現在的這個表情，明明和上次後勤處的哥哥姐姐們看到唱歌的小空的時候一樣啊......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蛇屠箱","speakerId":"char_150_snakekiller","isRemote":false,"text":"（原來如此！原來這就是尊敬啊！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蛇屠箱","speakerId":"char_150_snakekiller","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，還是好遺憾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"遺憾什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蛇屠箱","speakerId":"char_150_snakekiller","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......我本來還想，要是芙蓉姐當我的姐姐，那炎熔也該喊我姐姐了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蛇屠箱","speakerId":"char_150_snakekiller","isRemote":false,"text":"遺憾！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"你想得美！我才不會這麼喊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"而且明明我和芙蓉那傢伙一樣大，為什麼她是姐姐，我就是妹妹？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"搞清楚，我的個子可是比你們兩個都要高欸！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蛇屠箱","speakerId":"char_150_snakekiller","isRemote":false,"text":"這和身高無關啦，芙蓉姐很照顧我，所以是芙蓉姐，但炎熔總覺得就是比我年紀小嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"搞不懂你在說什麼......難道我不照顧你嗎！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蛇屠箱","speakerId":"char_150_snakekiller","isRemote":false,"text":"唔唔唔憋捏窩得臉辣——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，就該有人好好教教你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"記住了，千萬別以貌取人，特別是在面對一個薩卡茲的時候！我們薩卡茲的年齡和外貌可不是一回事！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蛇屠箱","speakerId":"char_150_snakekiller","isRemote":false,"text":"欸！難道炎熔就是那種看起來年輕的老婆婆嗎，就像華法琳醫生那樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"......那倒不是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蛇屠箱","speakerId":"char_150_snakekiller","isRemote":false,"text":"不是啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"......算了。就不該和你說這個的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，你這話千萬別給華法琳醫生聽到啊，百分百會被殺的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"就這樣，我還有點事，先走一步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蛇屠箱","speakerId":"char_150_snakekiller","isRemote":false,"text":"啊！炎熔要去哪裡玩，我也一起——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"不•可•以！不是去玩，你別跟過來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"我要稍微處理點事情......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"......沒人在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"奇怪了，這個時間了，按理說芙蓉她應該已經回來了啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"（真是的，都怪蛇屠箱那傢伙說了奇怪的話。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"（什麼叫把姐姐讓給她啊，又不是什麼物品，這怎麼可能讓......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"（才不是我小氣呢，要是真能換一換，別讓芙蓉她當我姐，我反而要謝天謝地好不好！兄弟姐妹這種事，我又沒辦法選......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"（......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"（......算、算了。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"（今天這事確實是我不該發脾氣，錯了就是錯了，才沒什麼不能承認的。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"（等芙蓉回來，就和她道歉——）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"這是什麼......蛋糕，還有，紙條？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼嘛，寫這麼、這麼煽情的東西，她就不害羞的嗎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"果然是邪惡的傢伙......真是太可惡了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"居然連道歉都要搶先我一步，這一點都不酷......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"（吃一大口蛋糕）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"噁，她又往裡面加了什麼奇怪的東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"還說什麼我肯定喜歡......哼，這根本就不夠甜，完全不合格。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"而且晚上留在醫療部，這傢伙不會忙起來又忘記吃飯吧？還說我不注意身體，她自己不也一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"沒辦法，看在蛋糕的份上，晚上我就勉為其難地去給她送點吃的好了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿，果然還是沒我不行嘛，這個笨蛋姐姐。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","aliases":["芙蓉"]},{"speakerId":"char_121_lava","aliases":["炎熔"]},{"speakerId":"char_150_snakekiller","aliases":["蛇屠箱"]}]}
